---
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<html lang="zh-CN">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
		<title>VMS (vms-blog)</title>
	</head>
	<body class="bg-[#F5F5F7] min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center font-sans antialiased text-[#222222]">
		<div class="max-w-md w-full mx-4 p-8 bg-white rounded-3xl shadow-sm border border-stone-200 text-center">
			<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-[#70C000] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl mx-auto mb-4 shadow-sm">V</div>
			<h1 class="text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-2">VMS · 数字花园</h1>
			<p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mb-4">Astro 5 + Cloudflare Pages + Tailwind CSS 成功就绪！</p>
			
			<div class="flex flex-col gap-2 items-center">
				<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#70C000]/15 text-[#559400] text-xs font-mono font-medium border border-[#70C000]/25">
					<span>● 边缘全栈运行环境正常</span>
				</div>
				<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-stone-100 text-stone-600 text-[11px] font-mono border border-stone-200">
					<span>⚡ GitHub 自动部署测试就绪</span>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</body>
</html>
